          "422": {
            "description": "Invalid pagination parameters (\`validation_failed\`)",
          },
        },
        "summary": "List the active workspace's forms, newest first",
        "tags": [
          "forms",
        ],
      },
      "post": {
        "description": "Runs in the FULL workspace context (active workspace resolved server-side via \`list_workspaces()\`). The default project is found through \`projects.is_default\`, never by name. Also creates the form's mutable draft row (empty envelope, \`draftVersion\` 0) and writes the \`form.created\` audit row and outbox event in the same transaction.",
